    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i'm not broken, it just feels like there's no point in \"finding next steps\" when the path just leads back to this same exhaustion. it's like i'm just waiting for a break that's never coming. everything is just so loud and heavy and i'm just so done with it all.",
